{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23419","headline":"香山寺石楼潭夜浴 · 白居易","name":"香山寺石楼潭夜浴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎光昼方炽，暑气宵弥毒。\n摇扇风甚微，褰裳汗霢霂。\n起向月下行，来就潭中浴。\n平石爲浴牀，洼石爲浴斛。\n绡巾薄露顶，草屦轻乘足。\n清凉咏而归，归上石楼宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}